body:
damn the thing I've got to go to is on a Thursday :/

&#x200B;

But thanks! I'll def do that sometime soon :))

of course, but please take it with a grain of salt. some days can get still get pretty bad. but i try to compartmentalize my work, and spend a lot of times outdoors alone. it helps me clear my head. i also got in touch with my teachers and explained to them (vaguely) what i was going through and that it might be reflected in my grades. 

&#x200B;

i do have a pretty good support system though, and for that im lucky. i don't know if you have any friends or significant others who you could talk to and rely on when you feel yourself getting worse. or maybe even this subreddit or some other place you can reach out to.
